    {
      "id": "update-flow",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "#EC4899",
      "text": "UPDATE FLOW\n\n1. Update available\n2. User clicks Install\n3. prepareForRestart()\n   - Save metadata (optional)\n   - Disconnect socket\n4. App quits\n5. Daemon keeps running\n6. App restarts (v2)\n7. connect() to daemon\n8. listSessions() returns\n   existing sessions\n9. Restore UI state\n10. Reattach to terminals"
    },
    {
      "id": "survival-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 551,
      "y": 658,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "#10B981",
      "text": "SESSION SURVIVAL\n\nDaemon process:\n- Spawned with detached: true\n- Runs independently\n- Holds PTY processes alive\n- Maintains scrollback buffers\n- Survives app restart/update"
    },
    {
      "id": "protocol-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 767,
      "y": 705,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "#6366F1",
      "text": "PROTOCOL MESSAGES\n\nClient -> Daemon:\n- create, write, resize\n- destroy, list, attach\n- ping\n\nDaemon -> Client:\n- created, data, exit\n- error, sessions\n- scrollback, pong"
    },
    {
      "id": "reconnect-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 765,
      "y": 907,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "#14B8A6",
      "text": "RECONNECTION\n\nOn disconnect:\n- Schedule retry (1s intervals)\n- Emit 'disconnected' event\n- UI shows status\n\nOn reconnect:\n- Sync session state\n- Reattach to sessions\n- Emit 'reconnected' event"
    },
